          "comment": "[Playbook] We do not accept liquidated damages or penalties payable by us, and 15% of annual Fees per week of delay would quickly exceed the contract value for a minor payment delay. We have replaced it with simple interest on undisputed overdue amounts, which preserves Vendor's remedy and is consistent with the interest reference in Section 7.3.",
